      "answer": "The most recent UFC event in the records is “Polymarket UFC 334: Gane vs Hokit” held on 2026‑11‑14 at Madison Square Garden in New York, and the card is listed as completed 【https://www.ufcalendar.com/】.  In the main‑event heavyweight bout, Ciryl Gane defeated Josh Hokit by unanimous decision after five rounds, while the women’s bantamweight title saw Kayla Harrison submit Amanda Nunes in round 4 【https://www.ufcalendar.com/】.  Other notable results include Caio Borralho winning a unanimous decision over Yousri Belgaroui, a majority draw between Uros Medic and Kevin Holland, and Luis Gurule beating Bilal Hasan by split decision 【https://www.ufcalendar.com/】.",
